        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>二、中国新闻史</title>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async\n  src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\">\n</script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif;\n    background-color: #ffffff;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 20px;\n    color: #333;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n\n  /* faint repeating watermark to mimic background texture in source image */\n  .watermark {\n    position: fixed;\n    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;\n    z-index: -1;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    opacity: 0.06;\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n  .watermark span {\n    position: absolute;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    color: #333;\n    transform: rotate(-25deg);\n  }\n\n  .title-bar {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n  }\n  .title-bar h1 {\n    display: inline-block;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    color: #c00000;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    padding-bottom: 6px;\n    border-bottom: 2px solid #c00000;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n\n  table {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 900px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    table-layout: fixed;\n  }\n\n  th, td {\n    border: 1px dashed #7f9db9;\n    padding: 8px 6px;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    text-align: center;\n    word-wrap: break-word;\n  }\n\n  thead th {\n    background-color: #d7e4f2;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    padding: 10px 6px;\n  }\n\n  col.col-1 { width: 15%; }\n  col.col-2 { width: 22%; }\n  col.col-3 { width: 33%; }\n  col.col-4 { width: 30%; }\n\n  td.level1 {\n    background-color: #f7f9fc;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    text-align: left;\n    padding: 12px 8px;\n  }\n\n  td.level2 {\n    text-align: left;\n    padding: 10px 8px;\n  }\n\n  td.level3 {\n    text-align: left;\n    padding: 10px 8px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n\n  td.remark {\n    text-align: left;\n    padding: 10px 8px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n  }\n\n  .dash {\n    color: #999;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"watermark\">\n  <span style=\"top:5%; left:10%;\">新传考硕人</span>\n  <span style=\"top:15%; left:60%;\">新传考硕人</span>\n  <span style=\"top:30%; left:20%;\">新传考硕人</span>\n  <span style=\"top:45%; left:70%;\">新传考硕人</span>\n  <span style=\"top:60%; left:15%;\">新传考硕人</span>\n  <span style=\"top:75%; left:55%;\">新传考硕人</span>\n  <span style=\"top:90%; left:25%;\">新传考硕人</span>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"title-bar\">\n  <h1>二、中国新闻史</h1>\n</div>\n\n<table>\n  <colgroup>\n    <col class=\"col-1\">\n    <col class=\"col-2\">\n    <col class=\"col-3\">\n    <col class=\"col-4\">\n  </colgroup>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th>一级考点</th>\n      <th>二级考点</th>\n      <th>三级考点</th>\n      <th>备注</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"level1\" rowspan=\"3\">1.中国古代的新闻传播活动</td>\n      <td class=\"level2\">（1）我国最早的报纸——唐朝的官报</td>\n      <td class=\"level3\">①《敦煌进奏院状》<br>②唐代报纸特点</td>\n      <td class=\"remark\" rowspan=\"3\">除了以上的重点，很多院校还会着重考察宋代的小报及以及小报的特点，大家可以对照自己院校的考纲和真题，做增删。</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"level2\">（2）定本制度</td>\n      <td class=\"level3\"><span class=\"dash\">—</span></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"level2\">（3）明清的官报和《京报》</td>\n      <td class=\"level3\"><span class=\"dash\">—</span></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"level1\" rowspan=\"4\">2.近代报业的产生和初步发展</td>\n      <td class=\"level2\">（1）第一批中文近代报刊</td>\n      <td class=\"level3\">①《察世俗每月统记传》<br>②《东西洋考每月统记传》<br>③第一批中文近代报刊特点与意义</td>\n      <td class=\"remark\" rowspan=\"4\">如果院校不考查名词解释，就可以对上面几点进行简单的了解，重点掌握外人在华办报的分析与评价；但是如果院校重点会考察一些名字解释和简答的话，前三点是大家需要掌握的重点哦。</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"level2\">（2）鸦片战争后外国人办报主要报纸</td>\n      <td class=\"level3\">①《字林西报》<br>②《万国公报》</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"level2\">（3）《申报》和中文商业性报刊的兴起和发展</td>\n      <td class=\"level3\">①《上海新报》<br>②《申报》：名词解释、简答和论述</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"level2\">（4）对外国人在华办报的分析与评价</td>\n      <td class=\"level3\">①外报垄断是殖民主义者的侵略行为<br>②外报在客观上促进了中西文化交流<br>③外报办报实践有助于我国报业发展</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
